    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "lead-in",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Think about the world",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:38px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 22px 0\">What problems does the world face today? Talk to your partner.</p><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:22px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Evidence</p>",
      "notes": "Pairs discuss for 2 minutes. Elicit a few ideas: pollution, poverty, hunger, war. Keep it brief."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "transition-vocab",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "Let's check your word knowledge",
      "notes": "Transition to vocabulary presentation. Say: These are words about world problems. We will learn nine of them."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-poverty",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈpɒvəti/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">poverty</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Many families live in poverty. They cannot buy food or warm clothes.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: If a family lives in poverty, do they have much money?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-education",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˌedʒuˈkeɪʃn/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">education</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">A good education opens doors. It helps you find a better job.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is education about learning at school?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-sanitation",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˌsænɪˈteɪʃn/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">sanitation</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Good sanitation keeps water clean. Without it, people get sick.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: What does sanitation give us? (clean water, safe toilets)"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-housing",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈhaʊzɪŋ/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">housing</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Cheap housing is hard to find in big cities. Many families share one small room.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is housing a place where people live?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-hunger",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈhʌŋɡə/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">hunger</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Hunger is a serious problem in poor areas. Some children sleep without food.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: If a child suffers from hunger, does the child have enough food?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-literacy",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈlɪtərəsi/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">literacy</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Literacy changes lives. With it, you can read news and contracts.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Can a person with literacy read and write?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-health",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/helθ/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">health</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Clean water is important for health. It stops diseases before they start.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: What is good for your health?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-conflict",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈkɒnflɪkt/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">conflict</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Conflict forces families to leave their homes. They search for safety far away.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: If two countries are in conflict, are they friends?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-pollution",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/pəˈluːʃn/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">pollution</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Air pollution is bad in big cities. It makes it hard to breathe.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: What causes air pollution? (cars, factories)"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "transition-listen",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "The Green Garden Project",
      "notes": "Transition to listening. Say: We will listen to a radio interview about a community garden."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "strategy-predict",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Strategy: Predict",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Do</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555\">Predict what Tom will say.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Why</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555\">It helps your brain focus.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">How</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">Read the questions. Think first.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Say: The title is The Green Garden Project. A volunteer talks on the radio. What might he talk about? Predict first, then listen."
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-predict",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Predict",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A volunteer talks on the radio about his project.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Which topics might he mention?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His favorite food.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A movie he watched.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The community garden.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His neighbors.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Ask students to predict which topics a volunteer might mention. Click to reveal the checkmarks."
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-predict",
      "step": 2,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Predict",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A volunteer talks on the radio about his project.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Which topics might he mention?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His favorite food.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A movie he watched.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center;color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900\">✓</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The community garden.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center;color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900\">✓</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His neighbors.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Revealed: the garden and his neighbors make sense. Food and movies are less likely for a radio talk about a project."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "gist-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:48px;margin-bottom:20px\">Listen &mdash; Gist</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:38px;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto\">What is the Green Garden Project?</p><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:24px\"><audio controls data-src=\"assets/dialog.mp3\" style=\"width:340px\"></audio></div>",
      "notes": "Play the dialog once. Students listen for the gist only: What is the Green Garden Project?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "gist-answer",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Gist — Answer",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">What is the Green Garden Project?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">It's a charity. It turned an old wasteland into a garden for the community.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Tom says the project is a charity in his area that made a garden for people.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">“It's a charity in our area. We turned an old wasteland into a garden.”</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Confirm the gist. The project is a community charity garden."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "detail-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:48px;margin-bottom:20px\">Listen again</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:16px\">Answer the questions.</p><div style=\"max-width:860px;margin:0 auto\"><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">1. How did Tom first get involved?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">2. What does the garden give the community?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">3. What is the fundraising campaign for?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">4. What did a local company do?</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px\"><audio controls data-src=\"assets/dialog.mp3\" style=\"width:340px\"></audio></div>",
      "notes": "Play the dialog again. Students answer the four detail questions. Then go through the answer slides."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (1/4)",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">1. How did Tom first get involved?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A neighbor encouraged him to join.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">He got to know the people in his area through the project.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">“A neighbor encouraged me to join.”</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Check the answer. Point out the words neighbor and encourage from the unit."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d2",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (2/4)",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">2. What does the garden give the community?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A safe place for children to play and fresh food for some families.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Children play there now, and the garden gives fresh food to families in poverty.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">“Children play there now.” “The garden gives them fresh food.”</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Check the answer. Point out the words poverty and hunger from the vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d3",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (3/4)",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">3. What is the fundraising campaign for?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">To buy more plants and equipment.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Tom says the money will buy what the garden needs to grow.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">“We want to buy more plants and equipment.”</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Check the answer. Point out the word fundraising from the unit."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d4",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (4/4)",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">4. What did a local company do?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">It donated a large sum of money.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The company gave money to help the project succeed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">“A local company just donated a large sum of money.”</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Check the answer. Point out the word donate from the unit."
