    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "ex1-answers-1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "body": "<style>.w1{border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px auto;max-width:860px;width:100%}.w1 td{padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:33px;vertical-align:top}.w1 .num{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;min-width:30px}.w1 .ans{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;border:2px solid #ffdd00;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:44px;margin-bottom:8px\">Exercise 1 — Answers</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin-bottom:10px\"><span class=\"box-word\">Check</span> your answers.</p><table class=\"w1\"><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">1</td><td>Some people don't have enough money to spend on basic things like food and shelter. <span class=\"ans\">poverty</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">2</td><td>Children need to go to school. <span class=\"ans\">education</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">3</td><td>Everyone needs clean water for drinking and washing. <span class=\"ans\">sanitation</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">4</td><td>People need safe places to live. <span class=\"ans\">housing</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">5</td><td>Some families don't have enough food. <span class=\"ans\">hunger</span></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Answers 1-5. Each click reveals the next row."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "ex1-answers-2",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "body": "<style>.w1b{border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px auto;max-width:860px;width:100%}.w1b td{padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:33px;vertical-align:top}.w1b .num{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;min-width:30px}.w1b .ans{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;border:2px solid #ffdd00;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:44px;margin-bottom:8px\">Exercise 1 — Answers</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin-bottom:10px\"><span class=\"box-word\">Continue</span> checking.</p><table class=\"w1b\"><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">6</td><td>The ability to read and write changes lives. <span class=\"ans\">literacy</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">7</td><td>We all need to be protected against illness and disease. <span class=\"ans\">health</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">8</td><td>In some parts of the world, communities and countries are at war with each other. <span class=\"ans\">conflict</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">9</td><td>The air, land, and water are dirty because of the actions of humans. <span class=\"ans\">pollution</span></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Answers 6-9. Continue checking."
    },
