      "body": "<style>.ex3a{border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px auto;max-width:880px;width:100%}.ex3a td{padding:7px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:32px;vertical-align:top}.ex3a .num{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;min-width:30px}.ex3a .ans{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;border:2px solid #ffdd00;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:44px;margin-bottom:8px\">Exercise 3 — Answers</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin-bottom:10px\"><span class=\"box-word\">Check</span> your answers.</p><table class=\"ex3a\"><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">1</td><td>She plans to <span class=\"ans\">teach herself</span> Spanish.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">2</td><td>Don't <span class=\"ans\">blame yourself</span> for what happened.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">3</td><td>I'm going to <span class=\"ans\">introduce myself</span> to Sophia.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">4</td><td>Be careful, Sam! Don't <span class=\"ans\">hurt yourself</span>!</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">5</td><td>We're not going to be home on time, so our guests will have to <span class=\"ans\">amuse themselves</span>.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">6</td><td>He <span class=\"ans\">convinced himself</span> that he was sick.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">7</td><td>We need to <span class=\"ans\">prepare ourselves</span> for difficult times.</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td class=\"num\">8</td><td>Welcome! <span class=\"ans\">Help yourselves</span> to coffee or tea.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Each click reveals the next row. Drill the reflexive pronouns after checking."
