    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "ex4-answers",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "body": "<style>.ex4a{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;color:#fff;font-size:30px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left}.ex4a .ans{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;border:2px solid #ffdd00;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:44px;margin-bottom:10px\">Exercise 4 — Answers</h2><div class=\"ex4a\"><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">I moved here two years ago with my family. We didn't know anyone at first, but then we met some of our <span class=\"ans\">neighbors</span> and after that, I <span class=\"ans\">got to know</span> more people in the area.</p><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">One day, I was talking to someone who <span class=\"ans\">encouraged</span> me to <span class=\"ans\">get involved</span> in a local community project.</p><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">It's a <span class=\"ans\">charity</span> called the Green Garden Project, and it's turned an area of wasteland into a beautiful green space for children to play.</p><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">I'm happy to <span class=\"ans\">volunteer</span> for such a <span class=\"ans\">good cause</span>.</p><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">There are people from all parts of the community but everyone <span class=\"ans\">respects</span> each other's <span class=\"ans\">rights</span> and freedoms.</p><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">Right now, we're running a <span class=\"ans\">fundraising</span> campaign so we can buy more plants and equipment.</p><p class=\"fragment\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">A local company has just <span class=\"ans\">donated</span> a large sum of money, which will make a huge difference in what we do.</p></div>",
      "notes": "The completed text with all 11 answers. Each click reveals the next paragraph."
    },
