      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Opinion</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">I think charity work helps communities.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Reason</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">One reason is it brings people together.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Evidence</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">For example, the project made a garden for everyone.</td></tr></table><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:22px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Evidence</p>",
      "notes": "Anchors the Opinion-Reason-Evidence structure before the discussion task."
